      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "For the past month I have been getting an absolutely unacceptable amount of timeouts. Ontop of that, those timeouts led you to the stuck-in-loading bug as well, which you can only resolve by restarting the game. Honestly I really don't want to restart my game thrice just to look at my avatar or world menu. And to join a friend, only to have to rejoin them again multiple times until the timeouts have stopped. Not only does this occur when opening menus, it also occurs when loading others avatars. Each VRchat session I go through at least 10 disconnects and I am not hyperbolizing.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
